        "name": "Matchstickman",
        "username": "Matchstickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-24T21:11:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Silverleaf\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silverleaf/48/2332_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Silverleaf:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;and I prefer that to Ascension's You Just Bought A Mediocre Card and That Revealed An Amazing Card That Your Opponent Can Now Buy That Will Help Them Win:The Card Game.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Sorry this is part of the game. If it's mediocre and you don't <em>need</em> it, don't buy it. It's as much about push your luck and knowing what your oponent wants as it is about efficient deck building.</p>",
