        "created_at": "2015-07-28T20:31:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Pydro\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/48/1844_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Pydro:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I hate it when fantasy books use \"normal\" names, but just change the spelling. Or when they use the exact same concept but change the name, just to change the name.</p>\n<p>It doesn't take 3 months to do, it takes 3 moons.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/f/fe5de2f79172c8380725afca4fccd136719f1e3d.png\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/fe5de2f79172c8380725afca4fccd136719f1e3d\" title=\"Except for anything by Lewis Carroll or Tolkien, you get five made-up words per story.  Im looking at you, Anathem.\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/f/fe5de2f79172c8380725afca4fccd136719f1e3d.png\" alt=\"Except for anything by Lewis Carroll or Tolkien, you get five made-up words per story.  Im looking at you, Anathem.\" data-base62-sha1=\"AieqztXg3BWZ9LtIYHit82ZsJhX\" width=\"466\" height=\"281\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Except for anything by Lewis Carroll or Tolkien, you get five made-up words per story.  Im looking at you, Anathem.</span><span class=\"informations\">466×281 16 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<aside class=\"onebox xkcd\" data-onebox-src=\"https://xkcd.com/483/\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://xkcd.com/483/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">xkcd.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <h3><a href=\"https://xkcd.com/483/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Fiction Rule of Thumb</a></h3>\n\n  <div class=\"xkcd-image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/f/fe5de2f79172c8380725afca4fccd136719f1e3d.png\" data-dominant-color=\"EDEDED\" width=\"466\" height=\"281\"></div>\n\n<p>Except for anything by Lewis Carroll or Tolkien, you get five made-up words per story.  I'm looking at you, Anathem.</p>\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
